    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Chronos Shift</i></strong>\u00a0is a puzzle-platformer title where you play as Aidan Novak, a young adventurer who stumbles into a time-twisting adventure.\u00a0Find your way home in this <strong>Fantasy-Driven, First-Person, Puzzle-Platformer!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ADVENTURE THROUGH ANCIENT RUINS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a series of levels that\u00a0hold varieties of\u00a0<strong>puzzles, undead enemies,  dangerous environments</strong>. Each new level brings a different problem to solve! From color coded platforms, moving structures, and hidden switches, each problem has a new and unique way to solve them!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MEETING YOUR NEW FRIEND TAS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipped with your new companion <strong><i>TAS</i></strong>, a sentient magical gauntlet, both of your new jobs are to find a way to escape the pocket dimension you've been transported to. Progress against a growing difficulty by unlocking <strong><i>TAS's</i></strong> new magical potential! Unlock new abilities and new ways to solve puzzles!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MANIPULATE TIME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to TAS, you've got one of the most powerful magics to keep you moving!<i> Time Manipulation</i>. Slow down enemies, hazards, and moving platforms. Use the flow of time to your advantage!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE DIVERSE AND ENGAGING SETTINGS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore both ancient ruins, and a steampunk research facility in order to free yourself, and break the time paradox that's trapped you!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Chronos Shift</i></strong>\u00a0is a puzzle-platformer title where you play as Aidan Novak, a young adventurer who stumbles into a time-twisting adventure.\u00a0Find your way home in this <strong>Fantasy-Driven, First-Person, Puzzle-Platformer!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ADVENTURE THROUGH ANCIENT RUINS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a series of levels that\u00a0hold varieties of\u00a0<strong>puzzles, undead enemies,  dangerous environments</strong>. Each new level brings a different problem to solve! From color coded platforms, moving structures, and hidden switches, each problem has a new and unique way to solve them!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MEETING YOUR NEW FRIEND TAS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipped with your new companion <strong><i>TAS</i></strong>, a sentient magical gauntlet, both of your new jobs are to find a way to escape the pocket dimension you've been transported to. Progress against a growing difficulty by unlocking <strong><i>TAS's</i></strong> new magical potential! Unlock new abilities and new ways to solve puzzles!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MANIPULATE TIME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to TAS, you've got one of the most powerful magics to keep you moving!<i> Time Manipulation</i>. Slow down enemies, hazards, and moving platforms. Use the flow of time to your advantage!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE DIVERSE AND ENGAGING SETTINGS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore both ancient ruins, and a steampunk research facility in order to free yourself, and break the time paradox that's trapped you!</p>",
    "short_description": "Chronos Shift\u00a0is a puzzle-platformer as a young adventurer who stumbles into a time-twisting adventure. Solve puzzles, fight enemies, and navigate dangerous environments.Find your way home and escape a reality warping time paradox!",
